  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming Household Resilience through InclusiVe Economic Development in South Sudan (THRIVE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The THRIVE programme aims to bolster resilience in conflict and climate affected communities in Greater Upper Nile (GUN). Targeting eight priority counties in Upper Nile, Unity and Jonglei States, it will reach approximately 120,000 households with gender-responsive and inclusive livelihoods development, market system strengthening, financial inclusion, women&#x2019;s economic empowerment, climate adaptation, and social cohesion activities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of THRIVE is that target households will have economic and food security, and improved resilience to conflict and climate shocks and stresses.</narrative>
  </description>
